    "description": "Group Assignment 20.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN303 · Assessment 3/6</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13789 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FIN303 · Đầu điểm 3/6</span>\n<h2>Group Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13789 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Presentation in class and report submission; OP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Suggestion: Students are required to prepare a financial planning or a report on a practical issue (eg: cash holding, inventory management, etc)</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">OP1: Case study, Practical issueOP2: (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Comprehensive reading, understanding issues, presenting problems,Personal qualities: Individual responsibility, self-esteem, sociability, self-management, and integrity.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">By instructor</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 12 — Individual Assignment Guidelines</li><li>Session 27 — Group Assignment Guidelines</li><li>Session 30 — Assignment Discussion</li><li>Session 42 — Individual assignment submission</li><li>Session 51 — Group assignment submission</li><li>Session 55 — Group Presentations</li><li>Session 56 — Group Presentations</li><li>Session 57 — Group Presentations</li><li>Session 58 — Group Presentations</li><li>Session 59 — Group Presentations</li><li>Session 60 — Group Presentations</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 12 — Individual Assignment Guidelines</li><li>Buổi 27 — Group Assignment Guidelines</li><li>Buổi 30 — Assignment Discussion</li><li>Buổi 42 — Individual assignment submission</li><li>Buổi 51 — Group assignment submission</li><li>Buổi 55 — Group Presentations</li><li>Buổi 56 — Group Presentations</li><li>Buổi 57 — Group Presentations</li><li>Buổi 58 — Group Presentations</li><li>Buổi 59 — Group Presentations</li><li>Buổi 60 — Group Presentations</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
